• Implemented floating-point support throughout both differentiation paths.

  Changes include:

  - Added (flt F) as the clean f64 AST constructor.
  - Added floating constants as derivative leaves.
  - Added floating exponents:
      - (pow E (flt F))
      - Exponent decrement uses f64_from_string, sub_f64, and f64_to_string.

  - Added grounded float folding for add, sub, mul, and neg.
  - Added mixed num/flt arithmetic using i64_as_f64; results promote to flt.
  - Extended zero, one, and minus-one identities to floats.
  - Extended division-by-zero and UNDEFINED propagation to floating zero.
  - Preserved floating type for floating-zero annihilation.
  - Kept numbers-left canonicalization for both num and flt.
  - Updated documentation and added integer/float regression cases.

  Verification:

  - Plain engine: 11/11 correct, zero mistakes.
  - Post-process implementation: 21/21 correct, zero mistakes.
  - Fused implementation: 21/21 correct, zero mistakes.
  - Post-process and fused result sets are byte-for-byte identical.
  - All three MM2 files have balanced syntax.
  - git diff --check passes.

  Updated core files: bits/mm2/symbolic_differentiation/diff_engine.mm2, bits/mm2/symbolic_differentiation/diff_engine_fused.mm2, and bits/mm2/symbolic_differentiation/simplify.mm2.

  Worked for 16m 17s · done 8:26 AM
